  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_type": "isnad",
    "arabic_text": "وَعَنْهُ عَنْ عَلِيِّ بْنِ إِبْرَاهِيمَ عَنْ أَبِيهِ عَنِ ابْنِ أَبِي عُمَيْرٍ عَنْ مَنْصُورِ بْنِ حَازِمٍ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ قَالَ",
    "translations": {
      "en": "And from him, from Ali ibn Ibrahim, from his father, from Ibn Abi Umayr, from Mansur ibn Hazim, from Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him), who said:"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_type": "body",
    "arabic_text": "قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ: «لَا طَلَاقَ قَبْلَ نِكَاحٍ وَلَا عِتْقَ قَبْلَ مِلْكٍ».",
    "translations": {
      "en": "The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) said: 'There is no divorce before marriage, and no manumission before ownership.'"
    }
  },
